The tenant seccomp allowlist derives from Docker/Moby 29.8.2 and
github.com/moby/profiles/seccomp v0.2.3, licensed under Apache License 2.0.
The unmodified profile, its licence, the source pin and the quota-protection
changes are in bananawiki/ops/seccomp.

The container images include FFmpeg 9.0.2, licensed under LGPL 2.1 or later,
and Debian's LAME library, licensed under LGPL 2.0 or later. Their source,
configuration, licences and redistribution instructions are included in each
image at /usr/local/share/bananawiki/media. The FFmpeg build recipe and release
verification files are in docker/media in the source repository.

The container images also update the LGPL 2.1-or-later ACL library using
authenticated Debian packages, with a compatible GPL 3-or-later GNU tar.
Their source, licence and publisher-verification records, and the
corresponding GNU coreutils source, are included at
/usr/local/share/bananawiki/acl.

The list of common passwords that BananaWiki refuses as new passwords
(bananawiki/core/data/common-passwords.txt) is a subset of the UK NCSC's
PwnedPasswordsTop100k list (from Have I Been Pwned) as distributed in
SecLists, Copyright (c) 2018 Daniel Miessler, MIT License. The licence is
included in bananawiki/core/data/common-passwords.LICENSE.
